"opps":[
 {"a":"大","b":"小","note":"Both work with 很: 很大, 很小."},
 {"a":"多","b":"少","note":"Put them together and you get 多少 (duōshao), 'how many' or 'how much'."},
 {"a":"冷","b":"热","note":"Both describe weather and drinks: 很冷, 热茶."},
 {"a":"早上","b":"晚上","note":"Same 上 ending. 早 (early) and 晚 (late) are what change."},
 {"a":"上午","b":"下午","note":"Same 午 (noon). 上 (before) and 下 (after) give before and after noon."},
 {"a":"来","b":"去","note":"来 comes toward the speaker, 去 goes away from them."},
 {"a":"买","b":"卖","note":"Same sound shape, different tones: 买 mǎi (buy, third tone) and 卖 mài (sell, fourth tone)."},
 {"a":"上","b":"下","note":"上 is up or on, 下 is down or under. They also start and end things: 上班 and 下班, 上课 and 下课."},
 {"a":"前","b":"后","note":"Front and back. Add 边 after the noun: 学校前边, 学校后边."},
 {"a":"里","b":"外","note":"Inside and outside. 里 goes right after the noun, 外 takes 边: 房间里, 房间外边."},
 {"a":"男","b":"女","note":"They build words too: 男朋友 and 女朋友, 女儿, 女士."},
 {"a":"早","b":"晚","note":"Early and late. They are also in 早上 / 晚上 and 早饭 / 晚饭."},
 {"a":"上班","b":"下班","note":"上 starts it, 下 finishes it."},
 {"a":"上课","b":"下课","note":"上 starts it, 下 finishes it."},
 {"a":"有","b":"没有","note":"没 is how you say 'not' with 有. Never 不有."},
 {"a":"贵","b":"便宜","note":"Expensive and cheap. They do not share a character, so learn them as a pair."},
 {"a":"昨天","b":"明天","note":"Same 天 (day). 昨 is the past and 明 is next."},
 {"a":"去年","b":"明年","note":"Same 年 (year). 去 is the past and 明 is next."},
 {"a":"哥哥","b":"弟弟","note":"Older brother and younger brother. 哥哥 and 弟弟 both repeat a character."},
 {"a":"姐姐","b":"妹妹","note":"Older sister and younger sister."},
 {"a":"儿子","b":"女儿","note":"Son and daughter. Both contain 儿 (child)."},
 {"a":"这里","b":"那里","note":"Here and there. 这 is near and 那 is far."},
 {"a":"这边","b":"那边","note":"This side and that side. 这 is near and 那 is far."}
],

